|                                   "]"
|                           " but HTML 3.0 did not succeed for several reasons. The draft was considered very large at 150 pages and the pace of browser development, as well as the number of interested parties, had outstripped the resources of the IETF."
|                           <sup>
|                             about="#mwt216"
