|                             "browser wars"
|                           ".) These included extensions to control stylistic aspects of documents, contrary to the "belief [of the academic engineering community] that such things as text color, background texture, font size, and font face were definitely outside the scope of a language when their only intent was to specify how a document would be organized.""
|                           <sup>
|                             about="#mwt218"
