|                                 "14"
|                                 <span>
|                                   class="cite-bracket"
|                                   id="mwAaQ"
|                                   "]"
|                           " Dave Raggett, who has been a W3C Fellow for many years, has commented for example: "To a certain extent, Microsoft built its business on the Web by extending HTML features.""
