|                               "Inputs"
|                           <p>
|                             id="mwA7w"
|                             "
There are many possible ways a user can give inputs like:"
|                           <div>
|                             about="#mwt378"
|                             class="mw-highlight mw-highlight-lang-html mw-content-ltr"
|                             data-mw="{"name":"syntaxhighlight","attrs":{"lang":"html"},"body":{"extsrc":"\n<input type=\"text\"> <!-- This is for text input -->\n<input type=\"file\"> <!-- This is for uploading files -->\n<input type=\"checkbox\"> <!-- This is for checkboxes -->\n"}}"
