|                             "HTML attribute"
|                         "
"
|                         <p>
|                           id="mwBEg"
|                           "Most of the attributes of an element are "
|                           <a>
|                             href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Name–value_pair"
|                             id="mwBEk"
|                             rel="mw:WikiLink"
|                             title="Name–value pair"
|                             "name–value pairs"
|                           ", separated by "
|                           <code>
|                             id="mwBEo"
|                             <span>
|                               id="mwBEs"
|                               typeof="mw:Entity"
|                               "="
|                           " and written within the start tag of an element after the element's name. The value may be enclosed in single or double quotes, although values consisting of certain characters can be left unquoted in HTML (but not XHTML)."
|                           <sup>
|                             about="#mwt403"
|                             class="mw-ref reference"
|                             data-mw="{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-77"}}"
